{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-84",
  "title": "Brand Overview (3)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Brand Overview (3)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Positioning Statement:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"A seasoned cinematographer bridging classic artistry with modern motion, Faires A. Sekiya crafts visual stories that honor legacy while illuminating the future of film.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Brand Identity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Vibe:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Timeless Intensity** – Slow-burn drama meets dynamic energy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Eclectic Soul** – An improvisational spirit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Values:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Legacy, craftsmanship, collaboration, relentless passion."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Visual Identity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Color Palette:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Primary:** Midnight Blue (`#191970`) – Depth, sophistication, and cinematic mystery."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Accents:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Burnished Gold (`#D4AF37`) – For \"hot accents\" and vintage warmth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Deep Crimson (`#8B0000`) – Adds rhythmic contrast (nod to Motown/hip-hop energy)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Neutrals:** Charcoal Gray (`#2F2F2F`), Cream (`#F5F5DC`) – Balance the dark base."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Typography:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Headlines:** *Playfair Display* (serif) – Classic gravitas, evoking Michelangelo’s mastery."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Body Text:** *Inter* (sans-serif) – Clean, modern readability."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Imagery & Aesthetic:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Key Visuals:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- High-contrast stills from his reel (e.g., dramatic lighting in *Chi-Raq*)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Behind-the-scenes shots showing collaborative moments (e.g., Steadicam work on *Chicago Med*)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Textures:** Subtle film grain, parchment overlays, or antique brass accents (library-inspired)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Layout:** Structured like a \"lush library\" – curated sections with warm, shadowed lighting effects."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Narrative & Messaging**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Story Arcs:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Legacy:** Highlight his grandfather’s influence (*\"Painting with Light\"*) and his pilgrimage to see Michelangelo’s works."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Collaboration:** Spotlight pivotal projects (e.g., Michael Keaton’s directorial debut)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Craftsmanship:** Emphasize technical expertise (steadicam, lighting rigs) and 20+ years of credits."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Phrases:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "*\"Where Light Meets Motion\"*"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "*\"Honoring Masters, Crafting Futures\"*"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "*\"20 Years of Cinematic Alchemy\"*"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Website Strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Structure:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Homepage:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Hero video with Phil Collins’ crescendo (30-second reel teaser, autoplay muted)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Tagline: *\"Painting with Light Since 1995.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Portfolio:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Filterable credits (IMDb-style) with project posters and anecdotes (e.g., *Boss*, *Treme*)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Process:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Behind-the-scenes stories, gear breakdowns, and nods to Richardson/Seager’s influence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **About:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Personal journey (grandfather’s legacy, Michelangelo inspiration) + values manifesto."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**UX/UI Details:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Micro-Interactions:** Button hover effects mimicking film projector flickers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Rhythmic Scroll:** Subtle parallax animations synced to jazz/hip-hop beats."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Dark Mode Default:** Enhances midnight blue palette while ensuring readability."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Challenges & Solutions**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Avoiding \"Heavy\" Darkness:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use cream accents and gold highlights to break up dark sections."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Prioritize white space in text-heavy areas (e.g., Credits page)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Balancing Eclectic Influences:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use Motown-inspired gradients (deep red → gold) for CTAs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Retro-modern iconography (e.g., film reels styled with hip-hop edge)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. SEO & Content**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Keywords:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Veteran Steadicam Operator,\" \"Chicago Cinematographer,\" \"Film Lighting Expert.\"**Backlink Strategy:**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Partner with film blogs for guest posts on \"Old-School Techniques in Modern Film.\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. Final Recommendations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Mood Board:** Combine Renaissance art textures, 70s concert posters, and modern cinematic stills."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tone of Voice:** Authoritative yet approachable (e.g., a seasoned mentor sharing wisdom)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Launch Hook:** A blog series titled *\"Lessons from the Masters\"* – blending his grandfather’s teachings and Michelangelo’s impact."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}